Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:11:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 53/53] fix(image): a solid layer sized 0x0 draws nothing

Music player widgets keep their scripts (the player's settings, the
accent color it shares) on a solid layer the scene sizes 0x0. A solid
layer with no size of its own was drawn at the scene's size, so these
covered the whole wallpaper in white.

A 0x0 size the scene gives now draws nothing: the layer is built with a
1x1 texture so its FBOs are valid, and setup leaves it uninitialised as
it does a passthrough image without effects, while its scripts still
run. A solid layer the scene gives no size at all still covers the
scene. Image::sized records which of the two the scene said.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
